{"applicationId":"fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213","applicationName":"考勤管理","content":"(function () {\n    var logger = \"updateUser:{}\";\n    $.log.info(logger, \"函数开始执行\");\n\n    var uri = \"http://ehr.jsthqc.com:9872/myehr/form/cardformInitData.action?swaggerUserCode=apiManage\";\n    $.log.warn(\"准备发送请求，URI: \" + uri);\n\n\tvar body = {\n            \"order\": \"asc\",\n            \"offset\": \"0\",\n            \"limit\": \"1\",\n            \"containerParam\": {},\n            \"paramsMap\": {},\n            \"requestParam\": {},\n            \"sortParams\": {},\n            \"filter\": {\n            \"EMPVEMPLOYEENEW_CNAME\": \"\",\n            \"EMPVEMPLOYEENEW_EMPCODE\": \"\",\n            \"_INTERVAIL_MIN_ORGVCOMPANYNEW_OPTIME\": \"\",\n            \"_INTERVAIL_MAX_ORGVCOMPANYNEW_OPTIME\": \"\",\n            \"EMPVEMPLOYEENEW_CERTNO\": \"\"\n            },\n            \"userIds\": null,\n            \"formId\": \"7447\",\n            \"isView\": null,\n            \"heightGrade\": []\n        };\n    $.log.warn(\"请求体构造完成:{} \", JSON.stringify(body));\n\n    // 构建请求头，包含Postman中成功的Cookie\n    var headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n    };\n    $.log.warn(\"请求头:{} \", JSON.stringify(headers));\n\n    try {\n        // $.http.sendPost 返回的是字符串，不是对象 [6]\n        var responseString =$.httpclient.sendPost(uri,null,headers,$.json.objectToJsonString(body));\n\n        // 记录原始响应字符串\n        $.log.warn(\"HTTP响应（原始字符串）:{} \", responseString);\n\n        // 将响应字符串解析为JSON对象\n        var repsJson;\n        try {\n            repsJson = $.json.stringToJsonObject(responseString);\n        } catch (e) {\n            $.log.error(\"解析响应JSON失败: \", e.toString());\n            $.log.error(\"原始响应内容: \", responseString);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        // 根据Postman结果，接口直接返回包含 total 和 rows 的对象\n        // 注意：这里不再假设存在 code 字段（除非接口确实返回）\n        if (repsJson && repsJson.total >= 0) { // 检查 total 是否存在\n            $.log.info(logger, \"查询成功，总记录数: \" + repsJson.total);\n            var rows = repsJson.rows;\n            if (rows && rows.length > 0) {\n                $.log.warn(\"获取到 \" + rows.length + \" 条数据\");\n                // 处理 rows 数据\n                for (var i = 0; i < Math.min(rows.length, 5); i++) { // 示例：仅处理前5条\n                    $.log.info(logger, \"第\" + (i + 1) + \"条: \" + JSON.stringify(rows[i]));\n                }\n            } else {\n                $.log.warn(\"未查询到数据（rows为空）\");\n            }\n        } else {\n            $.log.error(\"接口返回异常或格式不符\", repsJson);\n        }\n    } catch (e) {\n        $.log.error(\"脚本执行异常: \" + e.toString());\n    }\n\n    $.log.info(logger, \"函数执行结束\");\n})();","createTime":1770200305000,"createUserId":"1889706623013949441","customJsId":"","definitionId":"","hiddenCode":"8921253cfc2b412298710f6be61c9940","id":"192738858579574784","modelCode":"","modelId":"d37b5bf2704b4b3996edbbfdfbeaee74","modelType":"PC_BUSINESS_DESIGN","namespace":"更新人员","path":"员工信息","status":"NORMAL","tenantId":"9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e","updateTime":1770254309033,"versions":0.0}